-
-      /**
-       * Returns a new Collection.Set with values passed through a
-       * `mapper` function.
-       *
-       * ```
-       * Collection.Set([ 1, 2 ]).map(x => 10 * x)
-       * // Seq { 1, 2 }
-       * ```
-       *
-       * Note: `map()` always returns a new instance, even if it produced the
-       * same value at every step.
-       */
