- * | --------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------- |
- * | conf      | base set of values, which currentConfig could be **reset** to. | Dictionary | Required | Any Values, with respect to the secure Array |
- *
- * **Notes**: (default: current siteConfig ) (optional, default `getSiteConfig()`)
